It is a behavioural design pattern where a request is passed along a chain of handlers, each handler decides either
1: To process the request,or
2: to pass it to the next handler in the chain

Components:
1:Client:- Send requests to 1st handler
2:Handler:- which is interface/abstract class declared method to handle request and contains next handler refrence
3:Concrete Handler:- Implement handling logic and contains refrence to next handle (pass forward if not handled)
